                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "This is not a completion timeout.  This is a timeout between updates, and is not used at all unless the backend is very... very broken.  If a service needs longer than 5 minutes between subsequent updates, they haven't implemented the progress API correctly."
